id: S14
target: src/sello/scalar.nim
desc: geScalarmultBase: iteration-count off-by-one, 'for _ in 0 ..< 4: acc = geP3Double(acc)' -> '0 ..< 3', scaling the accumulator by 8 instead of 16 between the odd- and even-digit passes.
====OLD====
  for _ in 0 ..< 4:
    acc = geP3Double(acc)
====NEW====
  for _ in 0 ..< 3:
    acc = geP3Double(acc)
====END====
